    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Dan Field",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "timeZone": "Europe/London"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "em"
           }
          ],
          "text": "When committing a long running Fedora transaction, in which the time needed to perform the commit is long (due to a large total size of files of many gigabytes and a large numbers of files for example), the database connections needs to stay open for a long time without any activity because moving all those files from OCFL staging directory to the OCFL root (committing the OCFL persistent storage session, ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/a2ec2ac5b273670c421b74df1ad9174b3289f663/fcrepo-kernel-impl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/impl/TransactionImpl.java#L361"
            },
            "type": "link"
           },
           {
            "type": "em"
           },
           {
            "type": "underline"
           }
          ],
          "text": "fcrepo-kernel-impl/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/impl/TransactionImpl.java#L361",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "em"
           }
          ],
          "text": ") can take a considerable amount of time.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3970?src=confmacro"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
