  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A Number if users have reported issues with very large transactions. These issues can manifest in a number of ways including not reporting the closure of a transaction or timeouts from the server. This ticket is to gather these issues together and then generate individual tickets for each fix. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Initial investigations lead to some possible database improvements in the form of rewriting SQL statements, adding new indexes and upgrading the underlying database client libraries as part of the dependancy upgrade project. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
